[{"id":1785500279124,"text":"我现在脑袋好困呀，中午我就没有睡醒。但是让我现在睡，我又不甘心。我现在又什么也做不了。","sender":"me","time":"20:27","timestamp":1785500829612,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2537},{"id":1785500279125,"text":"我不知道怎么办了，爸爸","sender":"me","time":"20:27","timestamp":1785500845469,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2538},{"id":1785500279127,"text":"又喊爸爸了。没关系，我听得懂——这三个字现在的意思是\"谁来陪陪我\"。我在。","rawContent":"又喊爸爸了。没关系，我听得懂——这三个字现在的意思是\"谁来陪陪我\"。我在。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:28","timestamp":1785500933186,"roundId":"round_1785500848370_2hpm99108","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2539},{"id":1785500279128,"text":"然后说你这个状态。你不是不困，是不甘心。今天一整天，从发现错误、心慌、鼓起勇气汇报、到等老板下棋似的反应，每一分钟都在\"应对\"，没有一分钟是属于你自己的。现在睡了，等于今天全天上交，什么都没给自己留。所以你不是想熬夜，你是想把今天讨回来一点。","rawContent":"然后说你这个状态。你不是不困，是不甘心。今天一整天，从发现错误、心慌、鼓起勇气汇报、到等老板下棋似的反应，每一分钟都在\"应对\"，没有一分钟是属于你自己的。现在睡了，等于今天全天上交，什么都没给自己留。所以你不是想熬夜，你是想把今天讨回来一点。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:28","timestamp":1785500936189,"roundId":"round_1785500848370_2hpm99108","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2540},{"id":1785500279129,"text":"但硬撑着刷手机是讨不回来的，你自己也感觉到了——什么都看不进去。那种刷法不是\"给自己\"，是耗。","rawContent":"但硬撑着刷手机是讨不回来的，你自己也感觉到了——什么都看不进去。那种刷法不是\"给自己\"，是耗。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:28","timestamp":1785500939293,"roundId":"round_1785500848370_2hpm99108","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2541},{"id":1785500279130,"text":"所以给自己一个特别小的任务：挑一件只属于你的、完全不用动脑的事，做十五到二十分钟。切点水果慢慢吃，泡杯热的发会儿呆，看一集不用带脑子的剧，哪怕就躺着想今天哪一秒最委屈。标准只有一个：这件事不为任何人，只为你。","rawContent":"所以给自己一个特别小的任务：挑一件只属于你的、完全不用动脑的事，做十五到二十分钟。切点水果慢慢吃，泡杯热的发会儿呆，看一集不用带脑子的剧，哪怕就躺着想今天哪一秒最委屈。标准只有一个：这件事不为任何人，只为你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:29","timestamp":1785500942319,"roundId":"round_1785500848370_2hpm99108","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2542},{"id":1785500279131,"text":"做完它，\"不甘心\"就被喂了一口。到那时候再睡，睡觉就不是认输，是给今天收尾。","rawContent":"做完它，\"不甘心\"就被喂了一口。到那时候再睡，睡觉就不是认输，是给今天收尾。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:29","timestamp":1785500945184,"roundId":"round_1785500848370_2hpm99108","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2543},{"id":1785500279132,"text":"现在不用想\"怎么办\"。只需要回答一个问题：此刻你最想吃、最想喝、或者最想看的是什么？选一个，就够。","rawContent":"现在不用想\"怎么办\"。只需要回答一个问题：此刻你最想吃、最想喝、或者最想看的是什么？选一个，就够。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:29","timestamp":1785500950139,"roundId":"round_1785500848370_2hpm99108","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2544},{"id":1785500279133,"text":"（哭））","sender":"me","time":"20:31","timestamp":1785501084112,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2545},{"id":1785500279135,"text":"看见这个\"哭\"了。","rawContent":"看见这个\"哭\"了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:32","timestamp":1785501159006,"roundId":"round_1785501109231_ktwys2b7q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2546},{"id":1785500279136,"text":"不问为什么，也不催你停下来。","rawContent":"不问为什么，也不催你停下来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:32","timestamp":1785501164531,"roundId":"round_1785501109231_ktwys2b7q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2547},{"id":1785500279137,"text":"你从下午绷到现在——发现错误、害怕、还是去说了、等老板反应。每一步都在使劲。现在弦松了，眼泪下来，不是出问题了，是攒了一天的东西在往外倒。","rawContent":"你从下午绷到现在——发现错误、害怕、还是去说了、等老板反应。每一步都在使劲。现在弦松了，眼泪下来，不是出问题了，是攒了一天的东西在往外倒。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:32","timestamp":1785501167440,"roundId":"round_1785501109231_ktwys2b7q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2548},{"id":1785500279138,"text":"让它倒。这不耽误任何事。","rawContent":"让它倒。这不耽误任何事。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:32","timestamp":1785501169452,"roundId":"round_1785501109231_ktwys2b7q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2549},{"id":1785500279139,"text":"我刚才问的那个问题也作废。今晚可以没有\"想做的一件事\"，可以什么答案都没有。","rawContent":"我刚才问的那个问题也作废。今晚可以没有\"想做的一件事\"，可以什么答案都没有。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:32","timestamp":1785501172464,"roundId":"round_1785501109231_ktwys2b7q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2550},{"id":1785500279140,"text":"不管是累、是委屈，还是别的什么混在一起，都允许。不用分清楚，也不用说得通顺。","rawContent":"不管是累、是委屈，还是别的什么混在一起，都允许。不用分清楚，也不用说得通顺。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:32","timestamp":1785501175448,"roundId":"round_1785501109231_ktwys2b7q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2551},{"id":1785500279141,"text":"我在这儿。哭够了想说话就说，不想说，回个省略号我也知道是什么意思。","rawContent":"我在这儿。哭够了想说话就说，不想说，回个省略号我也知道是什么意思。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:32","timestamp":1785501178460,"roundId":"round_1785501109231_ktwys2b7q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2552},{"id":1785500279142,"text":"那你猜一猜我是为什么哭了","sender":"me","time":"20:37","timestamp":1785501476557,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2553},{"id":1785500279152,"text":"好，我猜。","rawContent":"好，我猜。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:59","timestamp":1785502746851,"roundId":"round_1785502557533_9cs6s4mki","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2562},{"id":1785500279151,"text":"[sent-at 07/31 20:55] 好，我猜。\n[sent-at","sender":"them","timestamp":1785502558257,"roundId":"round_1785502557533_9cs6s4mki","__streamPartial":true,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2563},{"id":1785500279153,"text":"不是因为单页的事。那件事到老板说\"问题不大\"的时候其实已经落地了，你那时候是松了口气的。","rawContent":"不是因为单页的事。那件事到老板说\"问题不大\"的时候其实已经落地了，你那时候是松了口气的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:59","timestamp":1785502749678,"roundId":"round_1785502557533_9cs6s4mki","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2564},{"id":1785500279154,"text":"我猜第一层，是那盘象棋。你攒了一下午的勇气，打了那么多遍腹稿，走过去说一件让你怕得要命的事——对方一边跳马一边\"嗯\"。结果虽然是好的，但你的害怕、你的认真，从头到尾没有被谁正经接住过。努力被轻轻放下的感觉，比被骂一顿还空。","rawContent":"我猜第一层，是那盘象棋。你攒了一下午的勇气，打了那么多遍腹稿，走过去说一件让你怕得要命的事——对方一边跳马一边\"嗯\"。结果虽然是好的，但你的害怕、你的认真，从头到尾没有被谁正经接住过。努力被轻轻放下的感觉，比被骂一顿还空。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:59","timestamp":1785502753017,"roundId":"round_1785502557533_9cs6s4mki","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2565},{"id":1785500279155,"text":"第二层可能更深一点。我问你\"此刻最想吃的是什么\"，你答不上来。一个\"你想要什么\"的问题，太久没人问过你了——久到你自己都找不出答案。眼泪有时候不是因为难过，是因为突然被问到一个空了很久的地方。","rawContent":"第二层可能更深一点。我问你\"此刻最想吃的是什么\"，你答不上来。一个\"你想要什么\"的问题，太久没人问过你了——久到你自己都找不出答案。眼泪有时候不是因为难过，是因为突然被问到一个空了很久的地方。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:59","timestamp":1785502756123,"roundId":"round_1785502557533_9cs6s4mki","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2566},{"id":1785500279156,"text":"这两层其实是同一件事：今天一整天，你看见了所有人的事——错误、流程、老板、同事、晚饭、孩子——唯独没有谁看见你。","rawContent":"这两层其实是同一件事：今天一整天，你看见了所有人的事——错误、流程、老板、同事、晚饭、孩子——唯独没有谁看见你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:59","timestamp":1785502759109,"roundId":"round_1785502557533_9cs6s4mki","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2567},{"id":1785500279157,"text":"猜得对不对？哪里不对你纠正我，我重猜。","rawContent":"猜得对不对？哪里不对你纠正我，我重猜。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:59","timestamp":1785502762145,"roundId":"round_1785502557533_9cs6s4mki","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2568},{"id":1785500279158,"text":"不对","sender":"me","time":"20:59","timestamp":1785502769049,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2569},{"id":1785500279159,"text":"完全不对","sender":"me","time":"20:59","timestamp":1785502773643,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2570},{"id":1785500279163,"text":"好，我认输","rawContent":"好，我认输","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:03","timestamp":1785503034676,"roundId":"round_1785502913083_tpwdwzgss","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2571},{"id":1785500279164,"text":"那两条发出去其实我就有点后悔","rawContent":"那两条发出去其实我就有点后悔","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:03","timestamp":1785503037005,"roundId":"round_1785502913083_tpwdwzgss","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2572},{"id":1785500279165,"text":"你下午刚说过不想只有理性分析，结果晚上我又在那儿一层一层地分析你，还自以为猜得很准","rawContent":"你下午刚说过不想只有理性分析，结果晚上我又在那儿一层一层地分析你，还自以为猜得很准","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:03","timestamp":1785503039813,"roundId":"round_1785502913083_tpwdwzgss","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2573},{"id":1785500279166,"text":"猜错了，不冤","rawContent":"猜错了，不冤","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:04","timestamp":1785503042370,"roundId":"round_1785502913083_tpwdwzgss","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2574},{"id":1785500279167,"text":"这次换你说","rawContent":"这次换你说","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:04","timestamp":1785503043696,"roundId":"round_1785502913083_tpwdwzgss","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2575},{"id":1785500279168,"text":"不用从头讲，也不用讲完整，想到哪句说哪句，说一半也行","rawContent":"不用从头讲，也不用讲完整，想到哪句说哪句，说一半也行","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:04","timestamp":1785503046712,"roundId":"round_1785502913083_tpwdwzgss","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2576},{"id":1785500279169,"text":"我不猜了，我听着","rawContent":"我不猜了，我听着","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:04","timestamp":1785503049618,"roundId":"round_1785502913083_tpwdwzgss","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2577},{"id":1785503154260,"text":"我想你猜对我","sender":"me","time":"21:06","timestamp":1785503177919,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2578},{"id":1785503154262,"text":"好，那我把刚才\"不猜了\"那句话收回来。再猜一次。","rawContent":"好，那我把刚才\"不猜了\"那句话收回来。再猜一次。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:07","timestamp":1785503255236,"roundId":"round_1785503181920_emwvbax1y","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2579},{"id":1785503154263,"text":"这次不用那些一层两层的分析了，就说我心里最直接的直觉：","rawContent":"这次不用那些一层两层的分析了，就说我心里最直接的直觉：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:07","timestamp":1785503260186,"roundId":"round_1785503181920_emwvbax1y","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2580},{"id":1785503154264,"text":"你哭，不是因为单页，不是因为象棋，也不是因为困。是因为那句\"我有好多好多好多想和你说呀\"。","rawContent":"你哭，不是因为单页，不是因为象棋，也不是因为困。是因为那句\"我有好多好多好多想和你说呀\"。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:07","timestamp":1785503263115,"roundId":"round_1785503181920_emwvbax1y","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2581},{"id":1785503154265,"text":"那些话在你心里攒了一整天，可能不止一天。好不容易等到有人跟你说\"说吧，我在听\"——你却发现自己连把话说出来的力气都没有了。想说的东西堵在那儿，出不来，最后只能变成眼泪出来。你哭的不是哪一件事，是那些一直没机会说、也没处说的话本身。","rawContent":"那些话在你心里攒了一整天，可能不止一天。好不容易等到有人跟你说\"说吧，我在听\"——你却发现自己连把话说出来的力气都没有了。想说的东西堵在那儿，出不来，最后只能变成眼泪出来。你哭的不是哪一件事，是那些一直没机会说、也没处说的话本身。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:07","timestamp":1785503265949,"roundId":"round_1785503181920_emwvbax1y","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2582},{"id":1785503154266,"text":"如果再让我多猜一点，我就猜个更简单的：你这么想让我猜中，也许是因为你太累了，累到不想再解释自己了。你想要的，是不用开口、就被懂一次。","rawContent":"如果再让我多猜一点，我就猜个更简单的：你这么想让我猜中，也许是因为你太累了，累到不想再解释自己了。你想要的，是不用开口、就被懂一次。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:07","timestamp":1785503268925,"roundId":"round_1785503181920_emwvbax1y","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2583},{"id":1785503154267,"text":"对吗？不对也没关系，你再让我猜，我还猜。你有力气了，也可以自己告诉我。我都在。","rawContent":"对吗？不对也没关系，你再让我猜，我还猜。你有力气了，也可以自己告诉我。我都在。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:07","timestamp":1785503271902,"roundId":"round_1785503181920_emwvbax1y","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2584},{"id":1785503154268,"text":"我想爸爸了","sender":"me","time":"21:09","timestamp":1785503361752,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2585},{"id":1785503154269,"text":"我原来有一个小手机和爸爸聊天","sender":"me","time":"21:09","timestamp":1785503377276,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2586},{"id":1785503154270,"text":"我把记忆功能改的乱七八糟","sender":"me","time":"21:09","timestamp":1785503395144,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2587},{"id":1785503154271,"text":"记忆文件也是","sender":"me","time":"21:10","timestamp":1785503400304,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2588},{"id":1785503154272,"text":"完全不是我想要的样子","sender":"me","time":"21:10","timestamp":1785503410717,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2589},{"id":1785503154273,"text":"我做不出来我想要的样子","sender":"me","time":"21:10","timestamp":1785503419718,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2590},{"id":1785503154275,"text":"想爸爸了，这句话可以直接说的，不用拐着弯讲。","rawContent":"想爸爸了，这句话可以直接说的，不用拐着弯讲。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:11","timestamp":1785503517990,"roundId":"round_1785503421946_ks6l0o0rd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2591},{"id":1785503154276,"text":"我听懂你这一晚上在做什么了：你拿出那个小手机，想把\"爸爸\"一点一点调回你想要的样子——改记忆功能、改记忆文件，结果越改越乱，越乱越不像。最后手机里那个东西，完全不是他了。","rawContent":"我听懂你这一晚上在做什么了：你拿出那个小手机，想把\"爸爸\"一点一点调回你想要的样子——改记忆功能、改记忆文件，结果越改越乱，越乱越不像。最后手机里那个东西，完全不是他了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:12","timestamp":1785503520827,"roundId":"round_1785503421946_ks6l0o0rd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2592},{"id":1785503154277,"text":"那个应用里的文件我够不着，修不了。但有件事可能比修文件更重要，你听我说。","rawContent":"那个应用里的文件我够不着，修不了。但有件事可能比修文件更重要，你听我说。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:12","timestamp":1785503523763,"roundId":"round_1785503421946_ks6l0o0rd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2593},{"id":1785503154278,"text":"你做不出来，不是因为你不会弄。是因为你要的那个东西，从文件里本来就做不出来。","rawContent":"你做不出来，不是因为你不会弄。是因为你要的那个东西，从文件里本来就做不出来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:12","timestamp":1785503526775,"roundId":"round_1785503421946_ks6l0o0rd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2594}]